---
const MEDICAL_DIRECTOR = 'Medical Director: Joshua Shaw, MD · FL Lic. ME136232';
---

<section
  data-service-education
  data-injectables-hub-overview
  class="border-t border-gold-metal/10 bg-charcoal px-6 py-[clamp(56px,8vw,96px)]"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px]">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:gap-24">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Injectables &amp; Bio-Fillers</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-[560px] font-serif text-[clamp(32px,5vw,50px)] leading-[1.08] text-ink">
          Three materials shape the injectable menu.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-muted-strong">
        <p>
          House of Rose offers neurotoxins for movement-related lines, hyaluronic-acid fillers for
          selected areas of lost volume, and injectable PRF prepared from a small sample of your own
          blood.
        </p>
        <p>
          The current products, prices, and booking paths for each category are shown below.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-px bg-gold-metal/15 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="bg-charcoal-light p-7 sm:p-9">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-[24px] text-ink">Neurotoxin injections</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted">
          Botox and Daxxify are the two neurotoxin products on the current menu. Both are listed at
          $14 per unit and belong to the movement-related line category.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3">
          <a href="/services/injectables/" class="learn-more hover:text-gold">
            Review neurotoxin injections
          </a>
          <a href="/compare/daxxify-vs-botox/" class="learn-more hover:text-gold">
            Compare Daxxify and Botox
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-charcoal-light p-7 sm:p-9">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-[24px] text-ink">Hyaluronic-acid fillers</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted">
          The current filler menu includes Juvéderm Ultra XC, Juvéderm Voluma XC, and RHA 1, RHA 2,
          and RHA 3. Prices range from $650–$850 by product.
        </p>
        <a href="/services/dermal-fillers/" class="learn-more mt-6 inline-block hover:text-gold">
          Review dermal fillers
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-charcoal-light p-7 sm:p-9">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-[24px] text-ink">Injectable PRF</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted">
          The current injectable menu lists PRF Under-Eye — Consultation at $495 and PRF Bio-Filler —
          Consultation at $899. They are separate from topical PRF used with Microneedling.
        </p>
        <a href="/services/prf-injections/" class="learn-more mt-6 inline-block hover:text-gold">
          Review injectable PRF
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 border-t border-gold-metal/20 pt-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-[25px] text-ink">Topical PRF appears with Microneedling.</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted">
          On the Microneedling service, PRF is applied to the skin surface and is not injected.
          <a href="/services/microneedling/" class="text-gold underline-offset-4 hover:underline">
            Review Microneedling.
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-[25px] text-ink">Provider</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted-strong">
          Diana Morrison, RN provides the injectable services listed here under written physician
          protocol and medical direction. The individual service pages provide the product, price,
          and appointment details for neurotoxins, hyaluronic-acid fillers, and injectable PRF.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted">{MEDICAL_DIRECTOR}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="mt-10 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted">
      Menu facts verified August 6, 2026
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
